<title>USA: Exar Corp Q4 net loss with charge vs profit.</title>
<headline>Exar Corp Q4 net loss with charge vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					Three Months Ended  Year Ended</p>
<p>					    March 31,	March 3l,</p>
<p>				     1997     1996     1997	1996</p>
<p> NET SALES		    $22,645  $28,938   $92,343 $125,766</p>
<p>COSTS AND EXPENSES:</p>
<p>   Cost of sales	     12,294   14,868    50,829   62,217</p>
