<p>     administrative	   5,248    6,465    21,796   24,911</p>
<p>   Goodwill amortization	344	343     1,374    1,315</p>
<p>Restructuring and other charges</p>
<p>				   15,044  (1,097)    15,044    2,448</p>
<p>				   41,180   24,516   107,581  107,007</p>
<p>INCOME (LOSS) FROM OPERATIONS</p>
<p>				 (18,535)    4,422  (15,238)   18,759</p>
<p> OTHER INCOME, NET		633	497     2,709    3,521</p>
