<p>				   (1.34)	.37    (1.01)     1.37</p>
<p>Shares used in computation</p>
<p>				    9,158    9,153     9,071    9,925</p>
<p>NOTE: Exar Corp said net income in the 1997 fourth quarter excluding charges was $1.06 million or $0.12 per share, compared with net income of $3.37 million or $0.37 per share for the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Exar said net income for fiscal 1997, excluding the one-time charges, was $4.2 million or $0.45 per share compared with $13.6 million or $1.37 a share for 1996.</p>
